@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Ingest synthetic handbook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/employee-handbook.json

### RAG answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/rag-question.json

### Remember user detail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/memory-intro.json

### Recall within same conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/memory-followup.json

### Different conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/memory-isolated.json

### Tool lookup, cache miss
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/tool-first.json

### Tool lookup in another conversation, cache hit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

< ./demo/tool-second.json
